# Echoing Ruin targets one of Bot2's two Ornithopters (artifact creatures). Bot2 answers with Snakeskin Veil on that
# Ornithopter: hexproof makes the spell's only target illegal on resolution, so the spell does not resolve (CR 608.2b) and
# the same-named other Ornithopter is not destroyed either, though the effect would have named it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Echoing Ruin
Mountain x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Snakeskin Veil
Forest x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Echoing Ruin.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Snakeskin Veil.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Ornithopter; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Keywords = Flying; Hexproof
Bot1.Graveyard = Echoing Ruin
Bot2.Graveyard = Snakeskin Veil
